---
import { clubs } from "../data/clubs.js";

// A few clubs as a preview; the rest are on the activities page.
const preview = clubs.filter((club) => club.preview);
---

<section id="about" class="bb-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h2 id="about-title" class="bb-section-word">About</h2>
    <div class="bb-cols">
        <div class="about-main bb-span-7">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Hi, I’m Brian, and I like building things where software meets hardware. Currently, I’m studying Computer Engineering at <a href="https://www.bu.edu/">Boston University</a>, and I’m happiest when code has to work on something real: a hexapod robot learning to walk in simulation, a rocket nozzle that made it through a hot-fire test, a PC that runs its own AI models.</p>
                <p>Right now I’m the Lead Software Engineer at <a href="https://gradientv.com/">GradientV</a>, building websites and AI tools for small businesses, and a Student TechOps Assistant at <a href="https://www.bu.edu/comtech/">BU’s College of Communication</a>. At <a href="/involvement/bu-ai-society/">BU AI Society</a> I lead the <a href="https://www.buaisociety.com/project-groups">Local LLM group</a>, where we work on studying how LLMs work, and on the side I run <a href="https://polygonpcs.com/">PolygonPCs</a>, building custom PCs and helping clients learn about them.</p>
                <p>In my free time you’ll usually find me playing volleyball or basketball, eating, spending time with my girlfriend, building PCs or playing video games.</p>
                <p>Thanks for checking out my portfolio!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="edu bb-span-5">
            <div class="edu-head">
                <img src="/logos/bu-wordmark.png" alt="Boston University" width="125" height="56">
                <div>
                    <p class="edu-degree">B.S. Computer Engineering</p>
                    <p class="muted">Boston University, class of 2029</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="club-preview">
                {preview.map((club) => (
                    <li>
                        <a href={club.description ? `/involvement/${club.slug}/` : club.href}>
                            <span class="logo"><img src={club.logo} alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy"></span>
                            <span class="club-preview-text"><span class="club-preview-name">{club.org}</span><span class="muted">{club.role}</span></span>
                            <span class="bb-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                ))}
            </ul>
            <p><a class="bb-btn" href="/involvement/">All activities <span class="bb-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
